# A stage0 sample: records, enums with payloads, exhaustive `match`, and an
# operation that raises its own error enum. `area` gives the area of a
# `Shape` (a square's side, a rectangle's two sides as a record, or a dot) and
# raises `AreaError.negativeSide` for a negative side; `main` prints each
# area, prints the error it catches, reads a labelled record's fields, and
# exits with code 4:
#
#   area: 9
#   area: 6
#   area: 0
#   refused a side of -2
#   corner: 3
shapes is module
shapes purpose "Compute areas of shapes held in enums and records, with an error enum of their own"
shapes path shapes
shapes imports standard.console
shapes imports standard.math
shapes imports standard.compare
shapes exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

Sides is record
Sides purpose "A rectangle's two sides"
Sides typeParameter none
Sides field width Int64
Sides field height Int64

Shape is enum
Shape purpose "A shape whose area can be computed"
Shape typeParameter none
Shape variant square Int64
Shape variant rectangle Sides
Shape variant dot none

AreaError is enum
AreaError purpose "Why an area cannot be computed"
AreaError typeParameter none
AreaError variant negativeSide Int64
AreaError variant tooLarge none

Label is record
Label purpose "A text with a position, so a record holds text"
Label typeParameter none
Label field text String
Label field column Int64

sideArea is operation
sideArea purpose "The area of a rectangle, refusing a negative side"
sideArea invariant none
sideArea typeParameter none
sideArea input width Int64 copied
sideArea input height Int64 copied
sideArea output Int64
sideArea outputOwnedBy none
sideArea raises AreaError
sideArea effect none
sideArea uses none
sideArea memoryHeap false
sideArea async false
sideArea maxRecursion none
sideArea label begin loopKind none
sideArea label begin within none
sideArea label heightTest loopKind none
sideArea label heightTest within none
sideArea label multiply loopKind none
sideArea label multiply within none
sideArea label badWidth loopKind none
sideArea label badWidth within none
sideArea label badHeight loopKind none
sideArea label badHeight within none
sideArea let zero Int64 0 immutable
sideArea at begin do widthCheck
sideArea at begin branch if widthNegative goto badWidth else goto heightTest
sideArea at heightTest do heightCheck
sideArea at heightTest branch if heightNegative goto badHeight else goto multiply
sideArea at multiply do product
sideArea at multiply return ok rectangleArea
sideArea at badWidth do makeWidthError
sideArea at badWidth return error widthError
sideArea at badHeight do makeHeightError
sideArea at badHeight return error heightError

widthCheck is call
widthCheck in sideArea
widthCheck invokes compare.lessThanInt64
widthCheck argument left Int64 width copy
widthCheck argument right Int64 zero copy
widthCheck result widthNegative Bool
widthCheck ownedBy none
widthCheck cleanedBy none
widthCheck borrows none
widthCheck catch none
widthCheck suppresses none

heightCheck is call
heightCheck in sideArea
heightCheck invokes compare.lessThanInt64
heightCheck argument left Int64 height copy
heightCheck argument right Int64 zero copy
heightCheck result heightNegative Bool
heightCheck ownedBy none
heightCheck cleanedBy none
heightCheck borrows none
heightCheck catch none
heightCheck suppresses none

product is call
product in sideArea
product invokes math.multiplyInt64
product argument left Int64 width copy
product argument right Int64 height copy
product result rectangleArea Int64
product ownedBy none
product cleanedBy none
product borrows none
product catch none
product suppresses none

makeWidthError is call
makeWidthError in sideArea
makeWidthError invokes AreaError.negativeSide
makeWidthError argument payload Int64 width copy
makeWidthError result widthError AreaError
makeWidthError ownedBy none
makeWidthError cleanedBy none
makeWidthError borrows none
makeWidthError catch none
makeWidthError suppresses none

makeHeightError is call
makeHeightError in sideArea
makeHeightError invokes AreaError.negativeSide
makeHeightError argument payload Int64 height copy
makeHeightError result heightError AreaError
makeHeightError ownedBy none
makeHeightError cleanedBy none
makeHeightError borrows none
makeHeightError catch none
makeHeightError suppresses none

area is operation
area purpose "The area of a shape"
area invariant none
area typeParameter none
area input shape Shape copied
area output Int64
area outputOwnedBy none
area raises AreaError
area effect none
area uses none
area memoryHeap false
area async false
area maxRecursion none
area label begin loopKind none
area label begin within none
area label ofSquare loopKind none
area label ofSquare within none
area label squareAreaDone loopKind none
area label squareAreaDone within none
area label ofRectangle loopKind none
area label ofRectangle within none
area label rectangleAreaDone loopKind none
area label rectangleAreaDone within none
area label ofDot loopKind none
area label ofDot within none
area label squareAreaFailed loopKind none
area label squareAreaFailed within none
area label rectangleAreaFailed loopKind none
area label rectangleAreaFailed within none
area let zero Int64 0 immutable
area at begin match shape Shape
area at begin case Shape.square bind side Int64 goto ofSquare
area at begin case Shape.rectangle bind sides Sides goto ofRectangle
area at begin case Shape.dot bind none none goto ofDot
area at ofSquare do squareArea
area at ofSquare branch ifError squareArea goto squareAreaFailed else goto squareAreaDone
area at squareAreaDone return ok squared
area at ofRectangle do readWidth
area at ofRectangle do readHeight
area at ofRectangle do rectangleArea
area at ofRectangle branch ifError rectangleArea goto rectangleAreaFailed else goto rectangleAreaDone
area at rectangleAreaDone return ok rectangled
area at ofDot return ok zero
area at squareAreaFailed return error squareAreaError
area at rectangleAreaFailed return error rectangleAreaError

squareArea is call
squareArea in area
squareArea invokes sideArea
squareArea argument width Int64 side copy
squareArea argument height Int64 side copy
squareArea result squared Int64
squareArea ownedBy none
squareArea cleanedBy none
squareArea borrows none
squareArea catch squareAreaError AreaError
squareArea suppresses none

readWidth is call
readWidth in area
readWidth invokes Sides.width
readWidth argument record Sides sides copy
readWidth result width Int64
readWidth ownedBy none
readWidth cleanedBy none
readWidth borrows none
readWidth catch none
readWidth suppresses none

readHeight is call
readHeight in area
readHeight invokes Sides.height
readHeight argument record Sides sides copy
readHeight result height Int64
readHeight ownedBy none
readHeight cleanedBy none
readHeight borrows none
readHeight catch none
readHeight suppresses none

rectangleArea is call
rectangleArea in area
rectangleArea invokes sideArea
rectangleArea argument width Int64 width copy
rectangleArea argument height Int64 height copy
rectangleArea result rectangled Int64
rectangleArea ownedBy none
rectangleArea cleanedBy none
rectangleArea borrows none
rectangleArea catch rectangleAreaError AreaError
rectangleArea suppresses none

printArea is operation
printArea purpose "Print the area of a shape, or the side it refused"
printArea invariant none
printArea typeParameter none
printArea input shape Shape copied
printArea output none
printArea outputOwnedBy none
printArea raises none
printArea effect write console.stdout
printArea uses stdoutWriter
printArea memoryHeap false
printArea async false
printArea maxRecursion none
printArea label begin loopKind none
printArea label begin within none
printArea label print loopKind none
printArea label print within none
printArea label writeLeadDone loopKind none
printArea label writeLeadDone within none
printArea label writeAreaDone loopKind none
printArea label writeAreaDone within none
printArea label refused loopKind none
printArea label refused within none
printArea label negative loopKind none
printArea label negative within none
printArea label writeRefusedDone loopKind none
printArea label writeRefusedDone within none
printArea label writeSideDone loopKind none
printArea label writeSideDone within none
printArea label tooLarge loopKind none
printArea label tooLarge within none
printArea label writeTooLargeDone loopKind none
printArea label writeTooLargeDone within none
printArea let areaText String "area: " immutable
printArea let refusedText String "refused a side of " immutable
printArea let tooLargeText String "too large" immutable
printArea at begin do compute
printArea at begin branch ifError compute goto refused else goto print
printArea at print do writeLead
printArea at print branch ifError writeLead goto writeLeadDone else goto writeLeadDone
printArea at writeLeadDone do writeArea
printArea at writeLeadDone branch ifError writeArea goto writeAreaDone else goto writeAreaDone
printArea at writeAreaDone return ok none
printArea at refused match areaError AreaError
printArea at refused case AreaError.negativeSide bind side Int64 goto negative
printArea at refused case AreaError.tooLarge bind none none goto tooLarge
printArea at negative do writeRefused
printArea at negative branch ifError writeRefused goto writeRefusedDone else goto writeRefusedDone
printArea at writeRefusedDone do writeSide
printArea at writeRefusedDone branch ifError writeSide goto writeSideDone else goto writeSideDone
printArea at writeSideDone return ok none
printArea at tooLarge do writeTooLarge
printArea at tooLarge branch ifError writeTooLarge goto writeTooLargeDone else goto writeTooLargeDone
printArea at writeTooLargeDone return ok none

compute is call
compute in printArea
compute invokes area
compute argument shape Shape shape copy
compute result computed Int64
compute ownedBy none
compute cleanedBy none
compute borrows none
compute catch areaError AreaError
compute suppresses none

writeLead is call
writeLead rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeLead in printArea
writeLead invokes console.write
writeLead argument text String areaText lend
writeLead result none
writeLead ownedBy none
writeLead cleanedBy none
writeLead borrows none
writeLead catch writeLeadError console.WriteError
writeLead suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeArea is call
writeArea rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeArea in printArea
writeArea invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeArea argument value Int64 computed copy
writeArea result none
writeArea ownedBy none
writeArea cleanedBy none
writeArea borrows none
writeArea catch writeAreaError console.WriteError
writeArea suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeRefused is call
writeRefused rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeRefused in printArea
writeRefused invokes console.write
writeRefused argument text String refusedText lend
writeRefused result none
writeRefused ownedBy none
writeRefused cleanedBy none
writeRefused borrows none
writeRefused catch writeRefusedError console.WriteError
writeRefused suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeSide is call
writeSide rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeSide in printArea
writeSide invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeSide argument value Int64 side copy
writeSide result none
writeSide ownedBy none
writeSide cleanedBy none
writeSide borrows none
writeSide catch writeSideError console.WriteError
writeSide suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeTooLarge is call
writeTooLarge rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeTooLarge in printArea
writeTooLarge invokes console.writeLine
writeTooLarge argument text String tooLargeText lend
writeTooLarge result none
writeTooLarge ownedBy none
writeTooLarge cleanedBy none
writeTooLarge borrows none
writeTooLarge catch writeTooLargeError console.WriteError
writeTooLarge suppresses console.WriteError.failed

main is operation
main purpose "Print the areas of four shapes, then a field of a record that holds text, and exit with code 4"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label writeTextDone loopKind none
main label writeTextDone within none
main label writeColumnDone loopKind none
main label writeColumnDone within none
main let doneCode ExitCode 4 immutable
main let three Int64 3 immutable
main let two Int64 2 immutable
main let minusTwo Int64 -2 immutable
main let cornerText String "corner: " immutable
main at begin do makeSquare
main at begin do printSquare
main at begin do makeSides
main at begin do makeRectangle
main at begin do printRectangle
main at begin do makeDot
main at begin do printDot
main at begin do makeBad
main at begin do printBad
main at begin do makeLabel
main at begin do readText
main at begin do readColumn
main at begin do writeText
main at begin branch ifError writeText goto writeTextDone else goto writeTextDone
main at writeTextDone do writeColumn
main at writeTextDone branch ifError writeColumn goto writeColumnDone else goto writeColumnDone
main at writeColumnDone return ok doneCode

scratch is region
scratch in main
scratch strategy arena
scratch maxBytes 65536
scratch released atReturn

makeSquare is call
makeSquare in main
makeSquare invokes Shape.square
makeSquare argument payload Int64 three copy
makeSquare result square Shape
makeSquare ownedBy none
makeSquare cleanedBy none
makeSquare borrows none
makeSquare catch none
makeSquare suppresses none

printSquare is call
printSquare in main
printSquare invokes printArea
printSquare argument shape Shape square copy
printSquare result none
printSquare ownedBy none
printSquare cleanedBy none
printSquare borrows none
printSquare catch none
printSquare suppresses none

makeSides is call
makeSides in main
makeSides invokes Sides.new
makeSides argument width Int64 two copy
makeSides argument height Int64 three copy
makeSides result sides Sides
makeSides ownedBy none
makeSides cleanedBy none
makeSides borrows none
makeSides catch none
makeSides suppresses none

makeRectangle is call
makeRectangle in main
makeRectangle invokes Shape.rectangle
makeRectangle argument payload Sides sides copy
makeRectangle result rectangle Shape
makeRectangle ownedBy none
makeRectangle cleanedBy none
makeRectangle borrows none
makeRectangle catch none
makeRectangle suppresses none

printRectangle is call
printRectangle in main
printRectangle invokes printArea
printRectangle argument shape Shape rectangle copy
printRectangle result none
printRectangle ownedBy none
printRectangle cleanedBy none
printRectangle borrows none
printRectangle catch none
printRectangle suppresses none

makeDot is call
makeDot in main
makeDot invokes Shape.dot
makeDot argument none
makeDot result dot Shape
makeDot ownedBy none
makeDot cleanedBy none
makeDot borrows none
makeDot catch none
makeDot suppresses none

printDot is call
printDot in main
printDot invokes printArea
printDot argument shape Shape dot copy
printDot result none
printDot ownedBy none
printDot cleanedBy none
printDot borrows none
printDot catch none
printDot suppresses none

makeBad is call
makeBad in main
makeBad invokes Shape.square
makeBad argument payload Int64 minusTwo copy
makeBad result bad Shape
makeBad ownedBy none
makeBad cleanedBy none
makeBad borrows none
makeBad catch none
makeBad suppresses none

printBad is call
printBad in main
printBad invokes printArea
printBad argument shape Shape bad copy
printBad result none
printBad ownedBy none
printBad cleanedBy none
printBad borrows none
printBad catch none
printBad suppresses none

makeLabel is call
makeLabel in main
makeLabel invokes Label.new
makeLabel argument text String cornerText lend
makeLabel argument column Int64 three copy
makeLabel argument region Region scratch lend
makeLabel result label Label
makeLabel ownedBy scratch
makeLabel cleanedBy none
makeLabel borrows none
makeLabel catch none
makeLabel suppresses none

readText is call
readText in main
readText invokes Label.text
readText argument record Label label lend
readText result text String
readText ownedBy none
readText cleanedBy none
readText borrows label
readText catch none
readText suppresses none

readColumn is call
readColumn in main
readColumn invokes Label.column
readColumn argument record Label label lend
readColumn result column Int64
readColumn ownedBy none
readColumn cleanedBy none
readColumn borrows none
readColumn catch none
readColumn suppresses none

writeText is call
writeText rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeText in main
writeText invokes console.write
writeText argument text String text lend
writeText result none
writeText ownedBy none
writeText cleanedBy none
writeText borrows none
writeText catch writeTextError console.WriteError
writeText suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeColumn is call
writeColumn rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeColumn in main
writeColumn invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeColumn argument value Int64 column copy
writeColumn result none
writeColumn ownedBy none
writeColumn cleanedBy none
writeColumn borrows none
writeColumn catch writeColumnError console.WriteError
writeColumn suppresses console.WriteError.failed
